  subtasks: Array<{
    title: string;
    description?: string;
    acceptance_criteria?: string[];
    depends_on?: string[];
  }>;
} | function decomposeGoal(summary: SummaryPayload): DecompositionPlan
Invariants: update `status = 'done'`; invariant that completion sets `status = 'done'`; only explicit completion logic updates `status = 'done'`

